TEST Create link - identity service unreachable returns 503 without touching the database

VARS
  AUTH_TOKEN: string length=32 charset=alphanumeric
  SLUG: string length=8 charset=alphanumeric
  DESTINATION: string pattern=https://example.com/[a-z0-9]{16}

RECEIVE HTTP:POST /links
WITH {{payloads/create_link_request.json}}
HEADERS
  Authorization: Bearer ${AUTH_TOKEN}
  Content-Type: application/json

EXPECT HTTP:GET http://identity-service/validate
HEADERS
  Authorization: Bearer ${AUTH_TOKEN}
RETURNS ERROR

EXPECT_NOT WRITE:POSTGRESQL links
EXPECT_NOT READ:POSTGRESQL links

RESPOND HTTP:503
